00:01:35.439 --> 00:01:37.189
So pumped about that.

00:01:38.388 --> 00:01:39.221
Let's do it.

00:01:39.221 --> 00:01:40.273
Day two.

00:01:40.273 --> 00:01:43.440
(upbeat techno music)

00:01:48.797 --> 00:01:50.008
Got my coffee.

00:01:50.008 --> 00:01:52.567
