00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:20.997
I made the wall.

00:02:20.997 --> 00:02:23.554
I made the wall of my video, guys.

00:02:23.554 --> 00:02:24.509
Look at that.

00:02:24.509 --> 00:02:28.014
So my plan, my usual networking strategy,

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:30.360
sit in a really busy
area, people walking by.

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:31.693
Let me show you.

00:02:35.823 --> 00:02:39.433
Sit in a really busy area
with people walking by.

00:02:39.433 --> 00:02:42.815
Wear the shirt, and do my thing.

00:02:42.815 --> 00:02:45.099
Get on social media, start posting,

00:02:45.099 --> 00:02:47.478
