00:03:05.142 --> 00:03:06.368
This is going to be fun
though, check it out.

00:03:06.368 --> 00:03:08.672
Check out the size of this room.

00:03:08.672 --> 00:03:09.589
It's legit.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:13.404
And I get to sit right here.

00:03:13.404 --> 00:03:18.048
The room is starting to
