00:03:44.517 --> 00:03:47.350
(uplifting music)

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.070
- First part of the day is done.

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:56.686
It's a fun event, fun crowd,
I'm so pumped to get on.

00:03:56.686 --> 00:03:59.629
I'm going to, they went for
