00:08:46.326 --> 00:08:48.909
(upbeat music)

00:08:59.509 --> 00:09:01.185
So the event is wrapping up.

00:09:01.185 --> 00:09:02.853
Lots of fun.

00:09:02.853 --> 00:09:05.399
Got to meet some new fans,
which has been great.

00:09:05.399 --> 00:09:07.723
Take a lot of selfies,
answer some questions.

00:09:07.723 --> 00:09:09.645
People are just kind of chilling now.

00:09:09.645 --> 00:09:12.257
Networking, grabbing some
food, some champagne,

00:09:12.257 --> 00:09:14.974
the cheese, the mozzarella cheese is nuts.

00:09:14.974 --> 00:09:15.807
I had to have a little,

00:09:15.807 --> 00:09:18.004
but Shawn's going to kill me, my trainer.

00:09:18.004 --> 00:09:20.975
But otherwise, everything's
been going really, really well.

00:09:20.975 --> 00:09:22.439
Just going to hang out a little bit longer

00:09:22.439 --> 00:09:24.909
and then I think there's some
other activities planned.

00:09:24.909 --> 00:09:27.957
I just go where my handler tells me to go.

00:09:27.957 --> 00:09:31.518
And then I connected with Nina,
so super happy about that.

00:09:31.518 --> 00:09:33.312
She's doing well, she
wants me to bring her back

00:09:33.312 --> 00:09:36.743
something special from Paris,
so I got to find something

00:09:36.743 --> 00:09:38.743
to bring home to Nina.

00:09:38.743 --> 00:09:41.781
Should be food related,
because Nina loves her food.

00:09:41.781 --> 00:09:45.948
So I got to find something that
is not too caloric, but tasty

00:09:47.586 --> 00:09:49.499
so that's going to be the challenge.

00:09:49.499 --> 00:09:51.306
If you guys have, well, I
can't ask you for advice

00:09:51.306 --> 00:09:54.384
because by the time you
watch this I'll be home.

00:09:54.384 --> 00:09:56.926
So, anyway, having fun.

00:09:56.926 --> 00:09:59.509
(upbeat music)

00:10:12.281 --> 00:10:14.852
My trainer's going to kill me for this.

00:10:14.852 --> 00:10:17.765
(upbeat music)

00:10:17.765 --> 00:10:21.922
All right, had a great
dinner with a savvier.

00:10:21.922 --> 00:10:24.422
And heading back to the hotel.

00:10:25.336 --> 00:10:27.925
So that restaurant that we
went to was run by a friend

00:10:27.925 --> 00:10:32.092
of his and he got some custom
stuff there at the end.

00:10:33.004 --> 00:10:35.748
So filling, but so amazing.

00:10:35.748 --> 00:10:38.746
Blew past my calorie
restriction for the day

00:10:38.746 --> 00:10:40.301
so Shawn is not going to be happy with me,

00:10:40.301 --> 00:10:42.384
but the rest of the day
was actually pretty solid,

00:10:42.384 --> 00:10:44.359
so I think we'll be okay.

00:10:44.359 --> 00:10:46.989
Going to head back to the hotel,
hopefully catch ahold of Nina.

00:10:46.989 --> 00:10:51.729
It's 10:30 Paris time, which
means it's 4:30 back home,

00:10:51.729 --> 00:10:53.374
so hopefully be able to get ahold of her.

00:10:53.374 --> 00:10:55.000
Connect and see how she's doing.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.639
Pack up and get ready to
head back home tomorrow.

00:10:58.639 --> 00:11:02.806
If I have some time, maybe
do a little bit on the town.

00:11:04.514 --> 00:11:08.601
And 11:00 a.m. on the
flight come back home.

00:11:08.601 --> 00:11:10.684
See my wife, I'm excited.

00:11:15.445 --> 00:11:16.965
Good morning, good morning, good morning.

00:11:16.965 --> 00:11:19.147
There's a fire alarm
going off in my building

00:11:19.147 --> 00:11:23.314
and just this morning they
had this crazy fire happening

00:11:24.209 --> 00:11:28.376
in London where it spread
super fast and hit 125 families

00:11:30.541 --> 00:11:33.775
so I'm watching on CNN and
then the fire alarm goes off

00:11:33.775 --> 00:11:34.717
in my building so it's like,

00:11:34.717 --> 00:11:36.951
okay, I got to get out of here ASAP.

00:11:36.951 --> 00:11:39.701
Hopefully everything's okay here.

00:11:40.978 --> 00:11:42.819
It's a little scary.

00:11:42.819 --> 00:11:47.778
I woke up, had ten hours of
sleep, which is fantastic.

00:11:47.778 --> 00:11:50.848
In the first two nights I actually had

00:11:50.848 --> 00:11:53.810
three and a half to four hours sleep.

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:56.312
So it feels good to have a solid ten.

00:11:56.312 --> 00:11:59.795
I didn't get a chance to
do anything this morning.

00:11:59.795 --> 00:12:02.684
I'm waiting for my ride to the airport,

00:12:02.684 --> 00:12:05.989
it's going to come in
about 20 minutes or so.

00:12:05.989 --> 00:12:08.409
And right now I just want
to get out of this building,

00:12:08.409 --> 00:12:10.492
with the alarm going off.

00:12:14.485 --> 00:12:16.485
I think I made it, whoo.

00:12:17.564 --> 00:12:18.481
So I'm out.

00:12:20.391 --> 00:12:23.141
Let's see where, what's going on.

00:12:23.141 --> 00:12:25.174
Get back to the lobby.

00:12:25.174 --> 00:12:26.108
I got to get home.

00:12:26.108 --> 00:12:27.848
I got to see my wife.

00:12:27.848 --> 00:12:30.079
All right, everything's okay.

00:12:30.079 --> 00:12:33.364
Time to breathe, relax, and be okay.

00:12:33.364 --> 00:12:38.153
Waiting on my ride to the
airport and get to fly home.

00:12:38.153 --> 00:12:40.986
(uplifting music)

00:12:55.523 --> 00:12:58.366
One of Nina's friends
and former co-workers

00:12:58.366 --> 00:13:01.455
collects Starbucks mugs in every city.

00:13:01.455 --> 00:13:05.203
But not just cities he goes
to, cities other people go to.

00:13:05.203 --> 00:13:07.940
And so he reminded Nina
that on my trip to Paris

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:11.658
I need to pick him up
a Starbucks Paris mug.

00:13:11.658 --> 00:13:14.226
Usually you can find them in the airport.

00:13:14.226 --> 00:13:17.256
So I'm looking for
Starbucks, for you Tony.

00:13:17.256 --> 00:13:20.257
I should be sitting in the
Air France lounge right now,

00:13:20.257 --> 00:13:22.858
relaxing, doing some
work, but I'm hustling

00:13:22.858 --> 00:13:25.180
trying to find a Starbucks for you, Tony.

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:26.526
You better appreciate it man.

00:13:26.526 --> 00:13:29.276
(cheerful music)

00:13:32.064 --> 00:13:35.807
So the options at the Air France
lounge are a lot healthier

00:13:35.807 --> 00:13:38.688
than the options at the Air
Canada lounge in Toronto.

00:13:38.688 --> 00:13:39.948
Check out what I got.

00:13:39.948 --> 00:13:43.076
Got some salad and tomatoes and cheese.

00:13:43.076 --> 00:13:46.659
Shrimp, mushrooms,
chicken, turkey, banana.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:52.249
Going to eat, do some
work, then board the plane.

00:13:52.249 --> 00:13:54.171
They've got power here on the plane,

00:13:54.171 --> 00:13:56.119
which means I can get some work done.

00:13:56.119 --> 00:13:58.460
So I'm either going to be doing videos

00:13:58.460 --> 00:14:00.147
with this wifi on the flight

00:14:00.147 --> 00:14:03.647
or I'm going to be working on my new book.

00:14:05.083 --> 00:14:07.833
(cheerful music)

00:14:10.847 --> 00:14:12.636
Just got off, got to get through Customs

00:14:12.636 --> 00:14:15.839
and then hopefully I get to see Nina.

00:14:15.839 --> 00:14:17.488
She's just leaving work
too, so we'll see if we can

00:14:17.488 --> 00:14:20.506
sync up our schedules
otherwise got to take Uber.

00:14:20.506 --> 00:14:22.207
Really hope I get to see Nina.

00:14:22.207 --> 00:14:24.957
(cheerful music)

00:14:28.722 --> 00:14:32.023
Look who I found, look who I found.

00:14:32.023 --> 00:14:34.433
It's Teemo and Nina!

00:14:34.433 --> 00:14:35.943
Kisses to the wife first.

00:14:35.943 --> 00:14:37.026
Hello mister.

00:14:39.234 --> 00:14:40.364
I miss this.

00:14:40.364 --> 00:14:42.351
We talked a lot about Nina.

00:14:42.351 --> 00:14:43.434
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:14:44.934 --> 00:14:46.601
- She missed me too.

00:14:47.495 --> 00:14:49.473
Okay, well thank you for joining me.

00:14:49.473 --> 00:14:52.450
Hope you have a great
weekend, continue to.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.689
- Believe.

00:14:53.689 --> 00:14:54.559
- And we'll see you soon.

00:14:54.559 --> 00:14:55.642
- Much love.

